{"title": "Forever Indebted (passive feature)", "pageid": 40226, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Forever_Indebted_(passive_feature)", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Explosion.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/Generic_Explosion.webp/300px-Generic_Explosion.webp, /w/images/4/48/Generic_Explosion.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/Generic_Explosion.webp/300px-Generic_Explosion.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/48/Generic_Explosion.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Forever Indebted</b> is a passive feature available to various debtors in the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Hope\" title=\"House of Hope\">House of Hope</a>. When damaged the user detonates, creating a big explosion and summoning a random fiendish creature.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>A debt to Raphael must be paid - even in death. Upon dying, the debtor explodes in damaging flames and is reincarnated as a fiendish creature bound to Raphael. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\"> Grants: </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Forever_Indebted\" title=\"Forever Indebted\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/40px-Fireball_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/60px-Fireball_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/80px-Fireball_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Forever Indebted\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp/40px-Fireball_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Fireball_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Forever_Indebted\" title=\"Forever Indebted\">Forever Indebted</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Errant_Soul\" title=\"Errant Soul\">Errant Soul</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Eternal_Debtor\" title=\"Eternal Debtor\">Eternal Debtor</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Upon dying, explodes in a fireball and is then reincarnated into a fiendish creature bound to Raphael.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715022346\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.040 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 695/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4642/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2290/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 211/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.008/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 701286/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   35.498      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   35.498      1 -total\n 17.66%    6.270      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 15.35%    5.450      1 Temp